[2026-01-30T15:33:25.960Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_01UQg8Z6sinoSBjET8tqBPHu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Implementation complete. Here's a summary:\n\n**Created `src/components/report/shared/analystPersonas.ts`:**\n\nDefines 6 analyst personas that represent the intelligence analyst role for each view:\n\n| View | Role | Persona | Description |\n|------|------|---------|-------------|\n| Overview | `executive` | Executive Analyst | Synthesizes findings into actionable summaries |\n| Findings | `evidence` | Evidence Analyst | Examines and validates individual findings |\n| Sources | `source` | Source Evaluator | Assesses credibility and trustworthiness |\n| Analysis | `contradiction` | Contradiction Detector | Identifies conflicts, gaps, inconsistencies |\n| Entities | `network` | Network Mapper | Maps relationships between entities |\n| Perspectives | `domain` | Domain Expert | Provides specialized contextual interpretation |\n\nEach persona includes:\n- `icon` - Visual identifier\n- `priorities` - What the analyst prioritizes when viewing data\n- `keyQuestions` - Key questions the analyst seeks to answer\n- Theme-specific gradient colors for visual distinction\n\n**Updated `ViewHeader` component:**\n\nAdded expandable persona details panel that shows:\n- Persona icon and title badge (clickable)\n- Description of the analyst role\n- List of priorities\n- Key questions the persona seeks to answer\n\n**Updated all views:**\n\n- `OverviewView` - `persona=\"executive\"`\n- `FindingsView` - `persona=\"evidence\"`\n- `SourcesView` - `persona=\"source\"`\n- `AnalysisView` - `persona=\"contradiction\"`\n- `EntitiesView` - `persona=\"network\"`\n- `PerspectivesView` - `persona=\"domain\"`\n\nThe personas create a mental model for users to understand what each view offers and can guide future UX decisions about information prioritization."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":234,"cache_read_input_tokens":114449,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":234},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"063d9692-0974-4418-8890-3933b0ef315a","uuid":"18b2700f-2f49-47ad-97d1-4119497cdd4d"}
